[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the fixing bolts (1a) and remove the front brake caliper\nbracket (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034881.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the two fixing pins.</p><p>2. Remove the front brake discs.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034882.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the brake discs and\ntighten the fixing pins to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Pin</p></td><td><p>FRONT BRAKE DISC.</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the brake caliper bracket on the disc\nand tighten the two fixing bolts to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT BRAKE CALIPER BRACKET</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>10.5</p></td></tr></table></div>"]]